          - ELECTIVE_CS
          - EMERGENCY_CS
          - FORCEPS
          - SVD
          - VACUUM
        description: |-
          Type of delivery

          * `SVD` - Spontaneous Vaginal Delivery
          * `ASSISTED_VAGINAL` - Assisted Vaginal Delivery
          * `ELECTIVE_CS` - Elective Cesarean Section
          * `EMERGENCY_CS` - Emergency Cesarean Section
          * `VACUUM` - Vacuum Extraction
          * `FORCEPS` - Forceps Delivery
