          * `DIGESTIVE` - Digestive
          * `URINARY` - Urinary
          * `REPRODUCTIVE` - Reproductive
          * `NERVOUS` - Nervous
          * `ENDOCRINE` - Endocrine
          * `LYMPHATIC` - Lymphatic
          * `SENSORY` - Sensory (Eye/Ear)
          * `DENTAL` - Dental
          * `GENERAL` - General/Multiple
      - in: query
        name: category
