          * `GENERAL` - General Surgery
          * `ORTHO` - Orthopedic
          * `CARDIAC` - Cardiac Surgery
          * `NEURO` - Neurosurgery
          * `EYE` - Ophthalmology
          * `ENT` - ENT Surgery
          * `OBSTETRIC` - Obstetric/Gynecology
          * `PEDIATRIC` - Pediatric Surgery
