        * `ON_CALL` - On-Call
        * `OVERTIME` - Overtime
        * `DAY_OFF` - Day Off
        * `NIGHT_OFF` - Night Off
        * `OFF` - Off (Full Day)
        * `AFTERNOON_OFF` - Afternoon Off
        * `LEAVE` - Leave
        * `SICK_LEAVE` - Sick Leave
        * `REST` - Rest Day
    ShiftTypeConfig:
      type: object
